   <|"Data" -> "### Accuracy of numerics\nEven if we slow down time (by \
decreasing the time steps of the simulation), we might still face issues if, \
for some reason, $x_{n}$ and $x_{n+1}$ turn out to be both outside the \
boundaries. It could be the result of some large impact:\n\n\n<div \
class=\"text-center w-full\"><svg version=\"1.1\" \
xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 637.2734375000001 \
