   <|"Data" -> ".md\n## Many-body Problem\nA well-known and common problem in \
computational physics, and not only there, is dealing with many entities \
coupled by a two-particle function.\n\nSimilarly to the constraints \
algorithm, one can resolve the collisions between balls or disks by \
offsetting their positions. This is not a completely physical approach, but \
it could approximate the case when particles collide in an inelastic way, \
losing momentum and energy to \
